```python
# ============================================================
# DJANGO CONNECTION — BIG PICTURE
# ============================================================

# HOW A REQUEST WORKS IN DJANGO:
#
# Browser/Postman sends request
#         ↓
# urls.py (main) — which app handles this?
#         ↓
# urls.py (app) — which view handles this?
#         ↓
# views.py — run the logic
#         ↓
# models.py — get data from database if needed
#         ↓
# views.py — send response back
#         ↓
# Browser/Postman receives response
#
# Today you set up the foundation
# Tomorrow (D2) — you create first app + first view + first URL
# This flow becomes completely clear by end of Week 3
```

